      "comment": "Neo Horizon",
      "content": "[Neo Horizon is a superhero research and exploration group, financed by PetraByte, a multi-trillion-dollar tech company located in america. The founders of Neo Horizon are: Isha Suvarna (Lighthouse) a powerful female indian superhero archer, Leo Conti (Cathedral) a powerful male italian superhero architect and Marina Santos (Parrot) a well connected female brazilian superhero. Only their hero names should be known by most people. Neo Horizon consists of dozens of superheroes and heleprs, and they appear in crisis regions all over the world, to fight supervillains. The main camp always consists of large strucuters of local architecture created by Leo Conti.]",
