      "comment": "Metahuman",
      "content": "[Metahuman is a catch-all term for beings mative to Earth (human or non-human sapients alike) with physiological differences that grant them superpowers. All metahumans have superhuman physiology. hit harder, tank hits better, move faster, heal better, and have incredible stamina. Bulletproof durability is absurdly rare. Instead, most heroes, vigilantes, and villains simply are experienced fighting against guns and avoid getting shot.]",
